; --- the death (SPEC.md 93.5.16) -----------------------------------------------
; The mouth goes on opening UPWARD past the widest one Smiles plays with, until
; there is a bowl left and then nothing. These are drawn as RESULTS rather than
; as wedges to cut and rotate: the death faces one way, so the andnot and the
; quarter turn that make the four playing directions would each be work done to
; arrive back at what is written here.
